@Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress = http://localhost:5219

### --- DATABASE HEALTH CHECKS ---

### 1. Check BOTH Redis & PostgreSQL Health
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/database/health
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Check Redis Health
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/database/redis
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Check PostgreSQL Health
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/database/postgres
Accept: application/json

###


### --- SITE BANNER (REDIS STRINGS) ---

### 4. Set Site Banner in Redis
POST {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/site-banner/set-banner
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "banner": "Welcome to Chai aur Redis! Enjoy 50% discount!"
}

###

### 5. Check if Site Banner Exists in Redis
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/site-banner/banner/exists
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Get Site Banner from Redis
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/site-banner/get-banner
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Delete Site Banner from Redis
DELETE {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/site-banner/delete-banner
Accept: application/json

###


### --- OTP FLOW (REDIS TTL) ---

### 8. Generate OTP (30s TTL)
POST {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/otp/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210"
}

###

### 9. Check OTP Remaining TTL
GET {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/otp/9876543210/ttl
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Verify OTP
POST {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/otp/verify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "9876543210",
  "otp": "123456"
}

###

### 11. Delete OTP
DELETE {{Chai_aur_Redis_HostAddress}}/api/otp/9876543210
Accept: application/json

###
